Chapter: CreatureSoundData

 Modified UOX3 creature SOUND_ATTACK, SOUND_DEFEND and SOUND_STARTATTACK data, GPL-2.0-or-later.
 Copyright 1997, 98 Marcus Rating (Cironian); see the retained UOX3 license.
 Source and limitations: WorldSpawns.md. License: ports/UOX3-LICENSE.txt.
  csd-limit : Integer = 638
  csd-sound : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  csd-sound (table) (body) (kind) = if body < 0 | body >= csd-limit then 0 else peek-16 table (body * 8 + kind * 2)
  csd-clear : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  csd-clear (table) (i) = if i == csd-limit then 0 else let z = poke-qword table (i * 8) 0 in csd-clear table (i + 1)
  csd-fill-0 : Integer -> Integer
